@namespace SpaceSails.Client.Pages.Stations
@*
    #251 item 1 · THE DESK'S HEADER BAR, ON ITS OWN FILE.

    Moved out of Pages/Stations/TrackingPost.razor by PURE MOTION — the block between the two fences
    below is the block that stood in the desk, character for character, at the indentation it had
    there. Every member it reads is a [Parameter] carrying the desk's own member UNDER THAT MEMBER'S
    OWN NAME (a field keeps its underscore, a method arrives as a delegate, a callback as itself),
    which is what lets the markup move without a rewrite and lets TrackingPostMarkup splice the desk
    back together byte for byte.

    The .razor.css beside this file carries no rules; it is there to give the component
    TrackingPost.razor.css's OWN scope (b-9ekzcovohe, pinned in SpaceSails.Client.csproj). That sheet
    has forty rules and not one `::deep` among them, so every single one of them is scope-dependent:
    without the carrier, every rule that styles this surface would stop matching the moment the markup
    moved out of the desk — no build error, no test, the card just renders unstyled.
*@
@* ── MARKUP BEGINS · verbatim from TrackingPost.razor ─────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
    <div class="card-header py-1 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-1">
        <span class="fw-bold small">Tracking post 📡</span>
        @if (FullScreen)
        {
            @* M27: the backdrop sun diagram is the live map — give the sensors chief its zoom. *@
            <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm" role="group" aria-label="Backdrop map zoom">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-light py-0" title="Zoom map out"
                        @onclick="() => OnZoomMap.InvokeAsync(1.6)">🔍−</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-light py-0" title="Zoom map in"
                        @onclick="() => OnZoomMap.InvokeAsync(1 / 1.6)">🔍+</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-light py-0" title="Center the ship"
                        @onclick="() => OnCenterShip.InvokeAsync()">⌖ ship</button>
            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" aria-label="Close" title="Close the tracking post and stow the telescope panel" @onclick="() => OnClose.InvokeAsync()"></button>
        }
    </div>
@* ── MARKUP ENDS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@

@code {
    // #251 item 1 · Every [Parameter] below is a member of TrackingPost under the member's own name.
    // A parameter that needs saying more than that says it on its own line.

    [Parameter] public bool FullScreen { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<double> OnZoomMap { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnCenterShip { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnClose { get; set; }
}
